		"text": "A temporary armor reduction, like the Railgun shattering armor. It stacks with stripped armor but wears off after a few seconds; a stronger break replaces a weaker one."},
	"barrier": {"title": "Barrier", "category": "effects", "see": ["barrier_grant", "strip"],
